{"id":"130b06c2-bae2-42f2-935e-1bf524cc4529","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"ddf05f77ce1c5915","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shell/feature.ts","baseline":{"blob":"9188a676e2fe21b85adbefd6b384122bde92775e","start":1275,"end":1373},"shape":{"type":"PropertySignature","atoms":["\"","control","\"","?",":","{","\"","place","\"",":","\"","start","\"","|","\"","end","\"",";","\"","Control","\"",":","FunctionComponent","<","{","\"","shell","\"",":","ShellContext","}",">","}",";"]},"context":{"before":"24ab17a17ac5e7e2","after":"e32129f1d178b4e9"}},"payload":{"text":"Its control in the top bar: with the workspace's (`start`, before the spacer) or with the editor's (`end`).","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:55:57.477Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:55:57.477Z"}
{"id":"17d12f3c-0daf-44d9-8bb9-9c74f35cbf6c","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"db424a653fd77e2b","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shell/feature.ts","baseline":{"blob":"755908a9f91c5cbc324fd12336d748cb41f8d864","start":942,"end":1032},"shape":{"type":"ExportDeclaration","atoms":["export","interface","ShellContext","{","\"","hub","\"",":","Hub",";","\"","rpc","\"",":","ReturnType","<","typeof","createRpcClient",">",";","}"]},"context":{"before":"19963f34a496fc94","after":"a96e922b5bac14bf"}},"payload":{"text":"What a feature is given: the shell's hub, linked to the app, and a client for asking over it.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:55:59.527Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:55:59.527Z"}
{"id":"603747d1-3539-4b95-beb5-38731f459c71","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"55a0fec184d99771","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shell/feature.ts","baseline":{"blob":"b8bd84177c9b82b82591cf9445b93b02555b119e","start":2592,"end":2750},"shape":{"type":"ExportDeclaration","atoms":["export","const","shared","=","createStore","<","{","\"","signedInAs","\"","?",":","string",";","\"","githubUser","\"","?",":","string",";","\"","boundRepo","\"","?",":","RepoBinding",";","\"","githubOpen","\"",":","boolean","}",">","(","{","\"","githubOpen","\"",":","false","}",")"]},"context":{"before":"77c773b85525fe9a","after":"b802b826d66ae054"}},"payload":{"text":"What the shell's features share. Signing in is optional: `signedInAs` says who (GitHub's login, or the account's\nemail; undefined = signed out); `githubUser` is GitHub's login when the sign-in is GitHub's (fetched live through the\nAPI's proxy), what private repos and commits need. `boundRepo` is the repository the workspace is a clone of (where a\ncommit pushes): the workspace's own origin, asked once the workbench answers (`git.origin`), and set again by each\nload. `githubOpen`: the GitHub popover, which a sign-in that failed or a load from the address opens.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:55:56.707Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:55:56.707Z"}
{"id":"70ffa7d1-944a-4630-812a-285d69026f09","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"24ab17a17ac5e7e2","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shell/feature.ts","baseline":{"blob":"c67f3d41be1bc25e0b07a6dd5d42a04a9926501a","start":1168,"end":1208},"shape":{"type":"PropertySignature","atoms":["\"","start","\"","?",":","(","shell",":","ShellContext",")","=>","void",";"]},"context":{"before":"ad647f363380047b","after":"ddf05f77ce1c5915"}},"payload":{"text":"Started once, when the shell's hub is linked to the app.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:55:58.809Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:55:58.809Z"}
{"id":"92359702-97d8-4fbe-858c-a774bb5ce0b5","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"abe1f8359c21a13b","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shell/feature.ts","baseline":{"blob":"0a7e67ee74f4900b45630579bffd4118979c2609","start":3724,"end":3792},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","thrown","=","error","as","string","|","number","|","boolean","|","null","|","undefined"]},"context":{"before":"842d5c935a6f7f3f","after":"29fff654eb7add72"}},"payload":{"text":"What isn't an Error is stringified as it is (a thrown string, if anything else).","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:55:55.320Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:55:55.320Z"}
{"id":"a1e66a2a-7da2-456c-bfd7-1b42220138d9","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"87055fbf7016fc8d","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shell/feature.ts","baseline":{"blob":"4ca7bd91e5992f8859f91758181c6e476f46c737","start":0,"end":63},"shape":{"type":"ImportDeclaration","atoms":["import","type","{","createRpcClient",",","Hub","}","from","\"","@brianjenkins94/hub","\""]},"context":{"after":"a041ab86c04cefed"}},"payload":{"text":"The shell's extension point: each feature of the top window is a module that registers what it adds — something to\nstart once the shell's hub is linked to the app (serves, subscriptions, what a page load finishes), a control in the\ntop bar, and anything it draws over the page — and the shell (shell.tsx) is the layout they're placed in. A feature\ncomes back by adding its module to the shell's list; nothing else of the shell changes.\n\nAnd what the features share: who's signed in, the repository the workspace is a clone of, and whether the GitHub\npopover is open — each a small store a feature reads with `useStore` and sets from anywhere.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:56:00.238Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:56:00.238Z"}
{"id":"d35d5a42-ab76-4275-a590-c4a8641024c8","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"b802b826d66ae054","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shell/feature.ts","baseline":{"blob":"58eae31200909feae82b985200536f5e32622ca6","start":3342,"end":3397},"shape":{"type":"ExportDeclaration","atoms":["export","const","githubLog","=","logger","(","{","\"","source","\"",":","\"","github","\"","}",")"]},"context":{"before":"55a0fec184d99771","after":"afc0196be80fa430"}},"payload":{"text":"The GitHub data plane's logger — spans + records federate to the `$sys.log.>` observability plane (debug-mcp).\nThe shell owns the token and the network calls, so this is where load/commit/connect are traced.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:55:56.024Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:55:56.024Z"}
